#: .\templates\portfolio\experience.html:11
msgid "Military & Special Operations"
msgstr "Militar y Operaciones Especiales"

#: .\templates\portfolio\experience.html:13
msgid ""
"Over two decades of service in the Army and Special Operations shaped my "
"ability to lead, adapt, and deliver under pressure. Mission planning, risk "
"assessment, and disciplined execution are now core to how I approach "
"software projects."
msgstr ""
"Más de dos décadas de servicio en el Ejército y Operaciones Especiales "
"formaron mi capacidad de liderar, adaptarme y rendir bajo presión. La "
"planificación de misiones, la evaluación de riesgos y la ejecución "
"disciplinada son ahora fundamentales en mi enfoque hacia los proyectos de "
"software."

#: .\templates\portfolio\experience.html:17
msgid "Full Stack Development Immersive · SDGKU"
msgstr "Full Stack Development Immersive · SDGKU"

#: .\templates\portfolio\experience.html:19
msgid ""
"Currently completing FSDI courses, including portfolio development with "
"Django, Agile architecture, and project management. I focus on building "
"portfolios that are not just visually appealing, but structurally sound and "
"easy to maintain."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente completando cursos FSDI, incluyendo desarrollo de portafolios "
"con Django, arquitectura ágil y gestión de proyectos. Me enfoco en crear "
"portafolios que no solo sean visualmente atractivos, sino estructuralmente "
"sólidos y fáciles de mantener."

#: .\templates\portfolio\experience.html:23
msgid "Strubell Publishing LLC · SGnG"
msgstr "Strubell Publishing LLC · SGnG"

#: .\templates\portfolio\experience.html:25
msgid ""
"From shed construction plans in Word and Excel to SGnG‑branded web "
"experiences, I design artifacts that are ready for real‑world use—clear, "
"documented, and aligned with professional standards."
msgstr ""
"Desde planos de construcción de cobertizos en Word y Excel hasta "
"experiencias web con la marca SGnG, diseño artefactos listos para el uso "
"real—claros, documentados y alineados con estándares profesionales."

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:9
msgid "Tim Strubell"
msgstr "Tim Strubell"

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:11
msgid "Developer · Veteran · Builder of Better Systems"
msgstr "Desarrollador · Veterano · Constructor de mejores sistemas"

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:14
msgid ""
"Strubell Goods & Gear (SGnG), a DBA of Strubell Publishing LLC, is my way of "
"turning discipline, craftsmanship, and code into tangible impact—from "
"leather aesthetics to full-stack solutions."
msgstr ""
"Strubell Goods & Gear (SGnG), una DBA de Strubell Publishing LLC, es mi "
"manera de convertir la disciplina, la artesanía y el código en impacto "
"tangible—desde la estética del cuero hasta soluciones full-stack."

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:17
msgid "View Portfolio"
msgstr "Ver portafolio"

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:22
msgid "What Drives Me"
msgstr "Qué me impulsa"

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:23
msgid "Military Precision:"
msgstr "Precisión militar:"

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:24
msgid ""
"23 years in Army and Special Operations forged my attention to detail, "
"resilience, and mission-first mindset."
msgstr ""
"23 años en el Ejército y Operaciones Especiales forjaron mi atención al "
"detalle, resiliencia y mentalidad de misión primero."

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:26
msgid "Technical Growth:"
msgstr "Crecimiento técnico:"

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:27
msgid ""
"Currently in the Full Stack Development Immersive at SDGKU, building modern, "
"responsive web experiences."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente en el programa Full Stack Development Immersive en SDGKU, "
"creando experiencias web modernas y responsivas."

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:29
msgid "SGnG Brand:"
msgstr "Marca SGnG:"

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:30
msgid ""
"High-quality leather aesthetics, unified systems, and professional "
"documentation—everything built to be clear, durable, and dependable."
msgstr ""
"Estética de cuero de alta calidad, sistemas unificados y documentación "
"profesional—todo construido para ser claro, duradero y confiable."

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:37
msgid "Strubell Goods & Gear · Strubell Publishing LLC"
msgstr "Strubell Goods & Gear · Strubell Publishing LLC"

#: .\templates\portfolio\home.html:39
msgid ""
"SGnG is the product arm of Strubell Publishing LLC, blending physical "
"craftsmanship with digital architecture. Whether it's a shed plan in Word "
"and Excel or a Django-powered portfolio, the goal is the same: build systems "
"that are understandable, maintainable, and ready for real-world use."
msgstr ""
"SGnG es la división de productos de Strubell Publishing LLC, combinando la "
"artesanía física con la arquitectura digital. Ya sea un plan de construcción "
"en Word y Excel o un portafolio desarrollado con Django, el objetivo es el "
"mismo: crear sistemas que sean comprensibles, mantenibles y listos para el "
"uso en el mundo real."

#: .\templates\portfolio\projects.html:10
msgid ""
"Every SGnG project blends military precision, technical clarity, and real-"
"world usefulness. These projects are powered by Django models and managed "
"through the admin panel, ensuring a scalable and maintainable portfolio "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Cada proyecto SGnG combina precisión militar, claridad técnica y utilidad "
"real. Estos proyectos están impulsados por modelos de Django y gestionados "
"a través del panel de administración, garantizando un sistema de portafolio "
"escalable y mantenible."

#: .\templates\portfolio\projects.html:31
msgid "View Project"
msgstr "Ver proyecto"

