#: .\templates\portfolio\skills.html:10
msgid ""
"Skills are modeled and managed via Django, showcasing both technical and "
"soft skills that support SGnG and Strubell Publishing LLC."
msgstr ""
"Las habilidades se modelan y gestionan mediante Django, mostrando tanto "
"habilidades técnicas como blandas que respaldan a SGnG y Strubell Publishing LLC."

